    "derived": "The gas constant in L atm mol⁻¹ K⁻¹ is not listed: it is the Avogadro constant times the Boltzmann constant (both exact), divided by the standard atmosphere in pascals, times 10³ (cubic meters to liters). The molar volumes are listed in m³ mol⁻¹ and printed in L mol⁻¹ (`scale` 3)."
